1
00:01:59,445 --> 00:02:01,445


2
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,389
Alright!

3
00:02:10,890 --> 00:02:14,032
Hop, hop! Hup, hup!

4
00:02:17,727 --> 00:02:19,849
I'm sorry. Help me!

5
00:02:21,874 --> 00:02:23,718


6
00:02:38,920 --> 00:02:42,038
A ship! It's so pretty! Wonderful! Cool!

7
00:02:42,420 --> 00:02:44,845
Oh, right! I'll go tell Sapphire!

8
00:02:52,180 --> 00:02:53,671
Sapphire, wake up, wake up!

9
00:02:54,007 --> 00:02:55,840
There's a lovely swan ship!

10
00:02:56,140 --> 00:02:57,180
A swan ship?

11
00:03:04,800 --> 00:03:07,240
Wow! What an amazing ship! Whose could it be?

12
00:03:07,644 --> 00:03:09,724
Hey, hey, let's hurry and check it out!

13
00:03:19,135 --> 00:03:20,701
I kind of want to step aboard.

14
00:03:21,620 --> 00:03:23,508
Please, please, step right on board.

15
00:03:23,880 --> 00:03:27,833
Grand Duke Duralumin had this ship custom-built specially for Lord Sapphire.

16
00:03:27,954 --> 00:03:29,304
Come on, right this way, please.

17
00:03:29,910 --> 00:03:32,949
<i>Grand Duke Duralumin? That seems a bit suspicious.</i>

18
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:36,701
<i>Still, it is tempting...</i>

19
00:03:38,940 --> 00:03:40,686
Come on, right this way.

20
00:03:42,030 --> 00:03:45,722
Well then, let me step aboard just for a moment and take a look inside.

21
00:03:53,625 --> 00:03:59,620
My dearest, I've prepared a wonderful present for you!

22
00:03:59,835 --> 00:04:00,537
Candy?

23
00:04:00,843 --> 00:04:06,608
It's nothing so simple. Tomorrow, all of Silverland will be yours.

24
00:04:07,921 --> 00:04:12,413
That beautiful swan ship was rigged from the very start.

25
00:04:12,740 --> 00:04:15,288
The ship's destination is... the Rose...

26
00:04:16,718 --> 00:04:17,399
Who's there?

27
00:04:18,456 --> 00:04:19,639
Oh, it's you.

28
00:04:20,070 --> 00:04:21,483
Everything is going smoothly.

29
00:04:21,710 --> 00:04:23,030
Are you sure about that?

30
00:04:23,304 --> 00:04:26,512
The ship has been rigged. Now we just sit back and watch.

31
00:04:26,860 --> 00:04:29,702
Everything on the island is set, too.

32
00:04:30,491 --> 00:04:35,053
On that deserted island, Sapphire will disappear without anyone knowing,

33
00:04:35,077 --> 00:04:39,080
and the rest will go according to your plan.

34
00:04:39,104 --> 00:04:40,993
Very well. Do it right..

35
00:04:44,310 --> 00:04:46,871
What a beautiful swan ship.

36
00:04:50,255 --> 00:04:51,255
That's amazing!

37
00:04:52,070 --> 00:04:53,492
It's beautiful.

38
00:04:54,940 --> 00:04:57,537
Traveling on a ship like this would be fun.

39
00:04:58,005 --> 00:04:59,759
Going on and on forever.

40
00:05:13,507 --> 00:05:16,127
This ship, it's moving on its own!

41
00:05:18,700 --> 00:05:21,480
Hey! Help me!

42
00:05:21,849 --> 00:05:24,820
Hey! Somebody!

43
00:05:27,206 --> 00:05:28,104
What's that?

44
00:05:28,560 --> 00:05:31,080
Hey! Help me!

45
00:05:31,120 --> 00:05:32,368
Sapphire!

46
00:05:34,681 --> 00:05:34,700
Marlin!

47
00:05:40,335 --> 00:05:41,741
Franz!

48
00:05:41,937 --> 00:05:43,288
Franz!

49
00:05:55,327 --> 00:05:56,937
Prince Franz!

50
00:05:56,962 --> 00:05:59,351
Franz!

51
00:06:09,022 --> 00:06:10,440
I guess it was no use...

52
00:06:17,273 --> 00:06:19,976
This rudder isn't working at all!

53
00:06:24,410 --> 00:06:26,516
We've been swept all the way out to sea.

54
00:06:41,189 --> 00:06:42,830
Franz is all the way over there!

55
00:06:43,400 --> 00:06:45,086
Sapphire, I'm coming!

56
00:06:46,025 --> 00:06:47,025
Here goes!

57
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:49,800
Franz!

58
00:07:09,230 --> 00:07:12,702
Glad I made it in time. I was just out for a morning walk.

59
00:07:22,815 --> 00:07:24,300
Wow, incredible!

60
00:07:29,110 --> 00:07:30,907
Hey, why don't you come inside here?

61
00:07:31,062 --> 00:07:32,260
Hmm? I'm fine right here.

62
00:07:57,704 --> 00:08:01,440
Wow, amazing. This island is full of roses.

63
00:08:07,770 --> 00:08:08,881
But it's strange.

64
00:08:09,015 --> 00:08:12,680
With all these flowers blooming, there isn't even a hint of that lovely scent.

65
00:08:13,244 --> 00:08:16,220
It's a strange island, but let's walk around a bit anyway.

66
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:24,120
A rose tunnel!

67
00:08:35,291 --> 00:08:38,036
Oh no, wait up!

68
00:08:46,687 --> 00:08:48,394
Where did Tink go?

69
00:08:50,729 --> 00:08:53,166
Tiiink!

70
00:08:53,945 --> 00:08:58,913
Tink! Tink! Tink! Where are you?

71
00:09:04,540 --> 00:09:05,540
R-Roses...!

72
00:09:10,734 --> 00:09:12,800
Sapphire! Look out! Something's wrong!

73
00:09:15,980 --> 00:09:16,980
Franz!

74
00:09:18,260 --> 00:09:19,280
What are these guys?

75
00:09:24,575 --> 00:09:27,799
Quick, hide behind me! Are you alright?

76
00:09:29,130 --> 00:09:32,054
I'm a man! Leave this to me!

77
00:09:34,589 --> 00:09:35,620
Here I come, monster cats!

78
00:09:39,559 --> 00:09:40,871
Franz! The cats!

79
00:10:13,476 --> 00:10:14,405
Franz!

80
00:10:14,694 --> 00:10:15,484
Sapphire!

81
00:10:26,398 --> 00:10:27,648
Franz!

82
00:10:42,039 --> 00:10:43,375
Sapphire!

83
00:11:02,499 --> 00:11:03,569
Take that!

84
00:11:13,739 --> 00:11:14,960
Over here, monster cats!

85
00:11:16,280 --> 00:11:17,617
You're facing the Ribbon Knight!

86
00:11:49,505 --> 00:11:50,505
Franz!

87
00:11:53,769 --> 00:11:55,537
Where on earth could he have gone?

88
00:11:56,645 --> 00:11:58,246
Franz!

89
00:11:59,040 --> 00:12:00,790
Franz!

90
00:12:01,160 --> 00:12:02,956
Tink!

91
00:12:03,440 --> 00:12:04,877
Tink!

92
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,656
Franz!

93
00:12:07,599 --> 00:12:09,539
Sapphire!

94
00:12:10,490 --> 00:12:11,230
Tink!

95
00:12:11,270 --> 00:12:12,270
Thank goodness.

96
00:12:12,670 --> 00:12:14,483
Tink, come on, pull yourself together.

97
00:12:15,781 --> 00:12:16,860
Thank you.

98
00:12:17,275 --> 00:12:19,097
Looks like Prince Franz was caught by the cats, too.

99
00:12:20,209 --> 00:12:22,040
I knew it, this island is no ordinary place.

100
00:12:22,985 --> 00:12:26,940
I'm sorry, it's my fault. I'll go search for Prince Franz!

101
00:12:27,829 --> 00:12:30,880
But searching a terrifying island like this...?

102
00:12:33,348 --> 00:12:34,200
Tink!

103
00:12:36,069 --> 00:12:36,835
How strange.

104
00:12:36,859 --> 00:12:39,053
This cobweb is as thick as a rope.

105
00:12:39,077 --> 00:12:42,060
There must be something going on. Let's follow this thread.

106
00:13:01,849 --> 00:13:03,856
So you're awake, Franz.

107
00:13:04,180 --> 00:13:07,117
Who are you?! Why did you capture me?!

108
00:13:07,220 --> 00:13:08,220
Me?

109
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:15,970
I am the guardian of this island, Spider Man.

110
00:13:16,385 --> 00:13:21,919
My master ordered me to take Princess Sapphire from the swan ship

111
00:13:21,944 --> 00:13:25,743
and wipe her out in total secrecy.

112
00:13:27,580 --> 00:13:30,280
I never expected to get a bonus like you along with her.

113
00:13:31,580 --> 00:13:34,320
I'll send you to heaven first!

114
00:13:35,729 --> 00:13:38,500
So everything was a trap from the start?

115
00:13:39,940 --> 00:13:40,944
Exactly.

116
00:13:40,968 --> 00:13:48,040
Now, prepare to share the same fate as pretty Princess Sapphire. Farewell!

117
00:14:28,921 --> 00:14:29,663
Franz

118
00:14:30,980 --> 00:14:31,980
Who are you?

119
00:14:33,229 --> 00:14:34,229
I came to save you.

120
00:14:36,219 --> 00:14:41,040
It's no use—this isn't ordinary thread. Wait, Tink, go find some water.

121
00:14:43,372 --> 00:14:44,372
Where's Sapphire?

122
00:14:45,449 --> 00:14:49,100
You don't think... Sapphire escaped safely! Rest assured!

123
00:14:49,725 --> 00:14:50,725
Thank goodness...

124
00:14:51,030 --> 00:14:53,905
But Ribbon Knight, just who are you to Sapphire?

125
00:14:54,415 --> 00:14:55,717
This is no time for that!

126
00:14:55,985 --> 00:14:58,300
We have to get out of here while the Spider Man is asleep!

127
00:14:59,485 --> 00:15:00,880
It's just water, what do we do with it?

128
00:15:01,385 --> 00:15:02,385
Hurry, splash it!

129
00:15:05,589 --> 00:15:06,589
Hurry, let's run!

130
00:15:12,326 --> 00:15:13,706
They ran off!

131
00:15:26,219 --> 00:15:27,620
I'm exhausted!

132
00:15:29,049 --> 00:15:31,420
Tink! Hurry, or they'll find us!

133
00:15:31,560 --> 00:15:33,828
Go on ahead! I can't go any further!

134
00:15:38,670 --> 00:15:39,460
Come on!

135
00:15:55,465 --> 00:15:59,820
A mere scratch from this sword is fatal. Take this!

136
00:16:03,399 --> 00:16:04,998
That goes for you over there, too!

137
00:16:23,189 --> 00:16:24,640
Franz! Hang in there!

138
00:16:25,240 --> 00:16:26,240
Are you all right?

139
00:16:27,229 --> 00:16:29,420
We have to get out of this forest fast!

140
00:16:32,239 --> 00:16:33,280
Stay strong!

141
00:16:42,168 --> 00:16:43,544
Just you wait!

142
00:17:02,149 --> 00:17:02,967
Tink,

143
00:17:02,991 --> 00:17:08,474
they say a cure grows wherever a venomous monster makes its nest.

144
00:17:08,499 --> 00:17:11,180
Look around here and find that herb for me.

145
00:17:11,420 --> 00:17:13,312
Understood. Right away...

146
00:17:15,309 --> 00:17:16,256
Sapphire...

147
00:17:16,788 --> 00:17:17,468
Yes!

148
00:17:17,991 --> 00:17:18,693
Damn it.

149
00:17:19,513 --> 00:17:20,264
Sapphire...

150
00:17:20,944 --> 00:17:21,913
Sapphire...

151
00:17:22,405 --> 00:17:23,733
He's having a nightmare.

152
00:17:24,749 --> 00:17:25,789
Poor thing...

153
00:18:01,839 --> 00:18:03,712
Hang in there, Franz!

154
00:18:04,960 --> 00:18:05,960
Sapphire!

155
00:18:09,809 --> 00:18:12,740
I'm right here. Rest easy.

156
00:18:13,404 --> 00:18:15,300
Thank you, Sapphire.

157
00:18:31,448 --> 00:18:35,560
I found it, I found it! Apply this, and the Spider Man's venom will...

158
00:18:36,062 --> 00:18:38,659
Huh? Now you're dressed as Sapphire...

159
00:18:39,819 --> 00:18:41,340
Quick, the herbs!

160
00:18:41,380 --> 00:18:42,012
Right!

161
00:18:43,080 --> 00:18:44,080
Will he be okay?

162
00:18:50,300 --> 00:18:51,464
He'll be fine now.

163
00:18:56,089 --> 00:18:58,147
Silence! I'll tolerate no excuses!

164
00:18:58,640 --> 00:19:01,300
True, I didn't tell you to kill Franz as well.

165
00:19:01,616 --> 00:19:05,046
But you're an assassin! How could you lose to a kid like that?!

166
00:19:05,070 --> 00:19:06,944
I haven't lost yet. 

167
00:19:06,968 --> 00:19:10,530
The moment he stabbed me, I wounded him with my dagger.

168
00:19:10,659 --> 00:19:14,740
By now, the poison has spread through his body. He can't possibly be alive.

169
00:19:15,249 --> 00:19:18,860
I came here to claim Princess Sapphire's body.

170
00:19:19,044 --> 00:19:20,580
A promise is a promise.

171
00:19:20,960 --> 00:19:24,700
Is the Spider Man such a coward to stay in bed over a mere scratch?

172
00:19:26,439 --> 00:19:30,060
Now, use your prized thread to get rid of Sapphire!

173
00:19:30,340 --> 00:19:34,240
If they're injured too, they couldn't have escaped the island yet.

174
00:19:34,580 --> 00:19:35,580
Now, go!

175
00:19:50,820 --> 00:19:51,820
Sapphire?

176
00:19:53,492 --> 00:19:54,209
Sapphire?

177
00:19:55,389 --> 00:19:58,520
Yeah. She nursed me all night long.

178
00:19:58,954 --> 00:20:02,827
King already put Sapphire on the swan ship and sent her back to the castle.

179
00:20:02,851 --> 00:20:03,592
I see... but...

180
00:20:04,616 --> 00:20:06,788
You must've been dreaming from your fever.

181
00:20:07,329 --> 00:20:09,540
Come on, we need to go fix the boat.

182
00:20:09,914 --> 00:20:11,320
You get some rest for now.

183
00:20:20,549 --> 00:20:22,520
That should take care of the chores, right?

184
00:20:22,939 --> 00:20:25,360
I'm all better now, too. We can finally go home.

185
00:20:26,359 --> 00:20:29,840
Not so fast! Princess Sapphire, I'll be taking your life!

186
00:20:30,125 --> 00:20:30,880
Spider Man?!

187
00:20:31,029 --> 00:20:34,391
You're wearing a ridiculous disguise, but you're Princess Sapphire, aren't you!

188
00:20:36,649 --> 00:20:37,992
I'm the Knight of the Ribbon.

189
00:20:40,863 --> 00:20:43,850
Doesn't matter. You won't leave this island alive.

190
00:20:44,163 --> 00:20:46,300
Get the little one!

191
00:20:54,912 --> 00:20:56,209
Let's go!

192
00:21:21,879 --> 00:21:23,860
That face doesn't scare me!

193
00:21:24,424 --> 00:21:27,220
Look, I brought some catnip.

194
00:21:46,739 --> 00:21:48,300
This is the end!

195
00:22:04,979 --> 00:22:06,280
Tink, are you alright?

196
00:22:07,159 --> 00:22:07,686
Yeah.

197
00:22:08,187 --> 00:22:11,548
They all ate the catnip and calmed right down.

198
00:22:15,800 --> 00:22:17,124
Damn, foiled again!

199
00:22:17,148 --> 00:22:21,400
The Ribbon Knight, Tink, and Franz... They're formidable foes.

200
00:22:21,780 --> 00:22:27,200
But I am Duralumin! I won't back down like this. Next time, for sure!

201
00:22:42,139 --> 00:22:45,892
Sapphire, even if they say it was just a fever dream,

202
00:22:45,916 --> 00:22:50,000
 I will never forget the happiness of that moment when you nursed me back to health.

203
00:22:50,788 --> 00:22:51,431
Franz,

204
00:22:52,103 --> 00:22:52,724
thank you.

205
00:22:54,888 --> 00:22:56,888

